# This repo's README and CONTRIBUTING are about this repo (the www.oiueei.com
# deployment), not the product. Upstream's are the whole-project documents and
# these two never track them, so a merge from `oiueei/standalone` should keep
# ours untouched. Requires `git config merge.ours.driver true` once per clone;
# without it git falls back to a normal (conflicting) merge, which is still
# resolved "keep ours".
README.md merge=ours
CONTRIBUTING.md merge=ours
